# Nightshift main theme: "Lamplight", with "One Hour Lullaby" as its heart.
# Music box opening, the tune alone, the tune with the band, a waltz in F, the big return.
# G minor is the hinge: the sad chord in D major is also the door into F major.
tempo 88
meter 4/4
grid 8
key D major
form Intro A1 A2 B1 B2 A3 Outro

